ot control. It prevents you from getting raised off your hand or building a big pot with a marginal holding. Checking also allows you to induce bluffs from your opponent or call a reasonable bet, keeping their range wide (including hands you beat).\n\nReason: With Top Pair and a weak kicker out of position, checking controls the pot size and minimizes risk. It allows you to catch bluffs and avoid difficult situations against better kickers.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
